s=source('carr-thessalonians','Commentary on 1 Thessalonians 2:1-8','https://www.workingpreacher.org/commentaries/revised-common-lectionary/ordinary-30/commentary-on-1-thessalonians-21-8-6','Carr reads the remembered conduct as a defense of the teachers\x27 trustworthiness.','Scholarly study','historical','This is Carr\x27s interpretation. His Greek analysis, manuscript preference for infants, ancient teacher comparisons, and cited books were not independently verified. The selected WEB wording remains unchanged.')
