summaries=['Received faith amid suffering becomes an example to others.','Remembered care and work support trust during continued separation.','Timothy\x27s good report gives comfort and leads into renewed prayer.','Careful conduct and resurrection hope support daily work and shared comfort.','Waiting for an unknown day requires alert conduct and care for different needs.']
questions=['How does receiving the message amid suffering become an example to others?','Why does Paul ask the hearers to remember the teachers\x27 own conduct?','How does Timothy\x27s report give comfort to the teachers as well as the hearers?','Why does the account of the dead end with shared comfort?','How do different needs require different kinds of care?'];teach={1:'The selected Church lesson teaches sincere sharing through a faithful personal example.',2:'The selected Church lesson teaches sharing the gospel with sincerity and love.',3:'The selected Church lesson connects increased love with growing holiness.',4:'The selected Church lesson teaches gradual growth in holiness and work that supports others.'};chapters=[]
